    "name": "Playomoji",
    "steam_appid": 3669080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.poster.avif?t=1755284520\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.webm?t=1755284520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.mp4?t=1755284520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, jump, roll.</strong><br>This is a parkour game. But here, it\u2019s not just about obstacles \u2014 you mess with your friends too. Troll them, throw them off balance, get ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer for up to 16 players.</strong><br>Play with friends or join an online lobby alone. Chaos and competition are always present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play on different maps.</strong><br>Each map has its own layout and challenges. The pace keeps changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics are waiting.</strong><br>Customize your character with outfits and looks. Unlock more by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple rules, lots of fun.</strong><br>The goal is clear: be the fastest or the funniest. How you play is up to you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.poster.avif?t=1755284520\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.webm?t=1755284520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669080/extras/b2adfe9dc840be8676c8944b2e4fbd27.mp4?t=1755284520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, jump, roll.</strong><br>This is a parkour game. But here, it\u2019s not just about obstacles \u2014 you mess with your friends too. Troll them, throw them off balance, get ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer for up to 16 players.</strong><br>Play with friends or join an online lobby alone. Chaos and competition are always present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play on different maps.</strong><br>Each map has its own layout and challenges. The pace keeps changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetics are waiting.</strong><br>Customize your character with outfits and looks. Unlock more by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple rules, lots of fun.</strong><br>The goal is clear: be the fastest or the funniest. How you play is up to you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Playomoji is a chaotic and fun 2D platformer you can play with up to 16 friends. Jump, slide, and take the weirdest paths to move forward, or sabotage your rivals and knock them off course!",
